The container images produced from this repository are an AGGREGATION of
independently licensed software. Each component is distributed under its own
license, and this NOTICE does not alter those licenses. The images are built
on the CloudNativePG PostgreSQL base image (Debian "bookworm") and install
PostgreSQL, its contrib modules and a set of extensions. Except where noted
below, third-party components are installed UNMODIFIED from the official
PostgreSQL APT repository (PGDG, https://apt.postgresql.org) and the Debian
archive; the sole exception is xatautils (Xata's own extension, Apache-2.0)
and, in the "analytics" variant, pg_duckdb, which are built from source.

Exact package versions are pinned per image variant and PostgreSQL major in
the extension manifests in this repository:
  docker/custom-postgres/extensions.<major>.json
  docker/analytics/extensions.<major>.json
  docker/experimental/extensions.<major>.json
  docker/minimal/extensions.<major>.json

