Copyleft (GPL / AGPL / LGPL) components and corresponding source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following components are covered by copyleft licenses. They are included
UNMODIFIED as distributed by PGDG/Debian. Because these images are published
publicly, the corresponding source is made available as described under
"Obtaining source code" below.

1. PostGIS  --  GPL-2.0-or-later
   Extensions: postgis, postgis_raster, postgis_sfcgal, postgis_tiger_geocoder,
   address_standardizer, address_standardizer_data_us
   Version:  3.6.x  (e.g. Debian package 3.6.4+dfsg-2.pgdg12+1)
   Debian packages: postgresql-<major>-postgis-3, postgresql-<major>-postgis-3-scripts
   Project: https://postgis.net  --  Source: https://git.osgeo.org/gitea/postgis/postgis
   Present in: custom-postgres, analytics, experimental (not in minimal).

2. pgRouting  --  GPL-2.0-or-later
   Extension: pgrouting
   Version:  4.0.x  (e.g. Debian package 4.0.1-1.pgdg12+1)
   Debian package: postgresql-<major>-pgrouting
   Project: https://pgrouting.org  --  Source: https://github.com/pgRouting/pgrouting
   Present in: custom-postgres, analytics, experimental (not in minimal).

3. Geometry/geoprocessing libraries linked by PostGIS (installed as
   dependencies of the PostGIS packages, unmodified from Debian):
     - SFCGAL          --  LGPL-2.0-or-later   (https://sfcgal.org)
     - CGAL            --  GPL-3.0-or-later / LGPL-3.0-or-later (https://www.cgal.org)
     - GEOS            --  LGPL-2.1-or-later   (https://libgeos.org)
