4. Base image and operating-system packages
   The CloudNativePG base image (ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql,
   *-minimal-bookworm) is licensed Apache-2.0. The underlying Debian "bookworm"
   userland contains packages under a range of licenses, including GPL and LGPL
   (e.g. glibc under LGPL, coreutils/util-linux under GPL). These are unmodified
   Debian packages, included by mere aggregation. The corresponding source for
   any Debian package is available from the Debian archive (see below).
   Note: the base is the CNPG "minimal" image, which does NOT include Barman
   (GPL-3.0).

